msgid ""
"The \"PD Separation Deployment\" mentioned in this document is provided only"
" as an example/reference design to demonstrate the basic process of "
"deploying Prefill and Decode in separated mode. It is not recommended for "
"use in the production environment."
msgstr ""
"本文档中提到的“PD 分离部署”仅作为示例/参考设计提供，用于演示以分离模式部署 Prefill 和 Decode 的基本流程。不建议在生产环境中使用。"

msgid ""
"**For the production environment on the customer side, [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend is recommended.**"
msgstr ""
"**对于客户侧的生产环境，推荐使用 [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend。**"

msgid ""
"Kimi K3 is a native multimodal Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) model. Its language "
"backbone combines Kimi Delta Attention (KDA) with periodic Gated Multi-head "
"Latent Attention (MLA), and uses Stable LatentMoE for expert computation. "
"The model also integrates a MoonViT vision encoder and supports text, image "
"understanding, reasoning, and tool calling."
msgstr ""
"Kimi K3 是一款原生多模态混合专家（MoE）模型。其语言主干网络将 Kimi Delta Attention（KDA）与周期性 Gated "
"Multi-head Latent Attention（MLA）相结合，并使用 Stable LatentMoE 进行专家计算。该模型还集成了 "
"MoonViT 视觉编码器，支持文本、图像理解、推理和工具调用。"

msgid ""
"This document will show the main verification steps of the model, including "
"supported features, feature configuration, environment preparation, multi-"
"node deployment on 950DT Products, Atlas 800 A3, and Atlas 800 A2, "
"functional verification, and AISBench evaluation."
msgstr ""
"本文档将展示该模型的主要验证步骤，包括支持的特性、特性配置、环境准备、在 Ascend 950DT系列产品、Atlas 800 A3 和 Atlas "
"800 A2 上的多节点部署、功能验证以及 AISBench 评测。"

msgid ""
"The current release includes a subset of the Kimi K3 optimization features "
"that have been validated for this version. To provide a reproducible and "
"supportable baseline, this guide uses fixed deployment configurations "
"instead of exposing every tunable optimization."
msgstr ""
"当前版本仅包含已针对该版本验证过的部分 Kimi K3 优化特性。为了提供可复现且可支持的基线，本指南使用固定的部署配置，而不是公开所有可调优的优化项。"

msgid ""
"These configurations position Kimi K3 for native multimodal inference, "
"reasoning and tool calling, and multi-node mixed Prefill/Decode or PD "
"separation deployments on 950DT Products, Atlas 800 A3, and Atlas 800 A2. "
"Additional optimization features and configuration guidance will be added in"
" later releases after validation."
msgstr ""
"这些配置使 Kimi K3 能够在 Ascend 950DT系列产品、Atlas 800 A3 和 Atlas 800 A2 "
"上支持原生多模态推理、推理与工具调用，以及多节点混合 Prefill/Decode 或 PD "
"分离部署。更多优化特性和配置指南将在后续版本经过验证后补充。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [supported "
"features](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) to get the "
"model's supported feature matrix."
msgstr ""
"请参阅[支持的特性](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)以获取该模型支持的特性矩阵。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [feature guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) to get the"
" feature's configuration."
msgstr "请参阅[特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)以获取该特性的配置。"

