msgid "### 5.1 Mixed Prefill/Decode Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 混合 Prefill/Decode 部署"

msgid "=== \"950DT Products (four-node)\""
msgstr "=== \"Ascend 950DT系列产品（四节点）\""

msgid ""
"The validated mixed deployment uses four 950DT Products nodes with eight "
"devices per node. vLLM data parallelism spans the four nodes, each node runs"
" one DP rank, and tensor parallelism uses all eight devices in the node. The"
" resulting topology is DP4/TP8/EP32."
msgstr ""
"经过验证的混合部署使用四个 Ascend 950DT系列产品节点，每个节点八个设备。vLLM 数据并行跨越四个节点，每个节点运行一个 DP "
"rank，张量并行使用节点内全部八个设备。最终拓扑为 DP4/TP8/EP32。"

msgid ""
"The 950DT Products feature set and service options are the same as A3, "
"except that 950DT Products uses TP8 and exposes eight devices per node. "
"Leave `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` unset for this mixed Prefill/Decode "
"deployment."
msgstr ""
"Ascend 950DT系列产品的功能集和服务选项与 A3 相同，区别在于 Ascend 950DT系列产品使用 TP8 "
"且每个节点暴露八个设备。对于此混合 Prefill/Decode 部署，请保持 `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` 未设置。"

msgid "Before starting the service:"
msgstr "启动服务之前："

msgid ""
"- Replace the model path, local IP address, network interface, service port, and DP RPC port with values from the target environment.\n"
"    - `NIC_NAME` must be the interface that owns `LOCAL_IP`.\n"
"    - Start Node 0 first. The `NODE0_IP` configured on Nodes 1 through 3 must equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node 0.\n"
"    - Assign `--data-parallel-start-rank` values `1`, `2`, and `3` to Nodes 1, 2, and 3 respectively."
msgstr ""
"- 将模型路径、本地 IP 地址、网络接口、服务端口和 DP RPC 端口替换为目标环境中的值。\n"
"    - `NIC_NAME` 必须是拥有 `LOCAL_IP` 的接口。\n"
"    - 先启动节点 0。节点 1 至 3 上配置的 `NODE0_IP` 必须等于节点 0 上的 `LOCAL_IP`。\n"
"    - 分别为节点 1、2 和 3 分配 `--data-parallel-start-rank` 值 `1`、`2` 和 `3`。"

msgid "=== \"Node 0\""
msgstr "=== \"节点 0\""

msgid "=== \"Nodes 1-3\""
msgstr "=== \"节点 1-3\""

msgid ""
"Run this command on every worker node. Set `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` to the "
"current node and set `DP_START_RANK` to `1`, `2`, or `3`."
msgstr ""
"在每个工作节点上运行此命令。将 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为当前节点，并将 `DP_START_RANK` 设置为 "
"`1`、`2` 或 `3`。"

msgid "The following values differ between the master and worker nodes:"
msgstr "以下值在主节点和工作节点之间有所不同："

msgid ""
"| Setting                       | Node 0         | Nodes 1-3         | "
"Description                                            |"
msgstr ""
"| 设置                          | 节点 0         | 节点 1-3          | 描述"
"                                                   |"

msgid ""
"    | `LOCAL_IP`                    | Node 0 IP      | Current worker IP | "
"Each node uses its own IP address.                     |"
msgstr ""
"    | `LOCAL_IP`                    | 节点 0 IP      | 当前工作节点 IP   | 每个节点使用自己的"
" IP 地址。                           |"

msgid ""
"    | `NODE0_IP`                    | Not required   | Node 0 IP         | "
"Workers use this address to join the DP group.         |"
msgstr ""
"    | `NODE0_IP`                    | 不需要         | 节点 0 IP         | "
"工作节点使用此地址加入 DP 组。                         |"

msgid ""
"    | `--headless`                  | Omitted        | Enabled           | "
"Workers do not expose the API endpoint.                |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--headless`                  | 省略           | 启用              | "
"工作节点不暴露 API 端点。                              |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-address`     | `$LOCAL_IP`    | `$NODE0_IP`       | "
"Always resolves to Node 0.                             |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-address`     | `$LOCAL_IP`    | `$NODE0_IP`       | "
"始终解析为节点 0。                                     |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank`  | `0` by default | `1`, `2`, or `3`  | "
"Every node must own a unique DP rank.                  |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank`  | 默认为 `0`     | `1`、`2` 或 `3`   | "
"每个节点必须拥有唯一的 DP rank。                       |"

msgid "Key deployment parameters:"
msgstr "关键部署参数："

msgid ""
"| Parameter                                   | Description"
"                                                      |"
msgstr ""
"| 参数                                        | 描述"
"                                                             |"

msgid ""
"    | `--tensor-parallel-size 8`                  | Uses all eight devices "
"in one 950DT Products node for tensor parallelism. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--tensor-parallel-size 8`                  | 使用一个 Ascend "
"950DT系列产品节点中的全部八个设备进行张量并行。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-size 4`                    | Creates four global DP "
"ranks across four nodes.                  |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-size 4`                    | 跨四个节点创建四个全局 DP rank。"
"                                 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-size-local 1`              | Runs one DP rank on the "
"current node.                            |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-size-local 1`              | 在当前节点上运行一个 DP rank。"
"                                   |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank`                | Selects the global "
"starting DP rank for a worker node.           |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank`                | 选择工作节点的全局起始 DP rank。"
"                                 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-rpc-port`                  | Must be identical and "
"reachable on every node.                   |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-rpc-port`                  | 在每个节点上必须相同且可访问。"
"                                   |"

msgid ""
"    | `--enable-expert-parallel`                  | Enables expert "
"parallelism for the MoE layers.                   |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--enable-expert-parallel`                  | 为 MoE 层启用专家并行。"
"                                          |"

msgid ""
"    | `--max-model-len 131072`                    | Sets the maximum "
"combined input and output length.               |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--max-model-len 131072`                    | 设置输入和输出的最大总长度。"
"                                     |"

msgid ""
"    | `--max-num-seqs 16`                         | Sets the maximum active "
"sequences for each DP group.             |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--max-num-seqs 16`                         | 设置每个 DP 组的最大活跃序列数。"
"                                 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--max-num-batched-tokens 24576`            | Controls the scheduler "
"token budget.                             |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--max-num-batched-tokens 24576`            | 控制调度器 token 预算。"
"                                          |"

msgid ""
"    | `--enable-prefix-caching`                   | Enables automatic prefix"
" caching.                                |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--enable-prefix-caching`                   | 启用自动前缀缓存。"
"                                               |"

msgid ""
"    | `--compilation-config`                      | Uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` "
"ACL Graph replay.                        |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--compilation-config`                      | 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` "
"ACL Graph 重放。                         |"

msgid ""
"    | `--tokenizer-mode kimi_k3`                  | Uses the Kimi K3 "
"tokenizer mode.                                 |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--tokenizer-mode kimi_k3`                  | 使用 Kimi K3 tokenizer 模式。"
"                                    |"

msgid ""
"    | `--additional-config`                       | Enables Ascend CPU "
"binding and FlashComm1.                        |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--additional-config`                       | 启用昇腾 CPU 绑定和 FlashComm1。"
"                                 |"

msgid ""
"    | `HCCL_IF_IP` and socket interface variables | Bind HCCL and Gloo "
"communication to the selected interface.      |"
msgstr ""
"    | `HCCL_IF_IP` 和 socket 接口变量             | 将 HCCL 和 Gloo 通信绑定到所选接口。"
"                             |"

msgid ""
"!!! note\n"
"        Serving a 1M-token context requires at least eight 950DT Products nodes. Change the following parameters on every node:"
msgstr ""
"!!! note\n"
"        服务 1M token 上下文至少需要八个 Ascend 950DT系列产品节点。在每个节点上更改以下参数："

msgid ""
"| Parameter                  | Four-node default | Eight-node (1M context) |"
msgstr "| 参数                       | 四节点默认值      | 八节点（1M 上下文）     |"

msgid ""
"        | `--data-parallel-size`     | `4`               | `8`"
"                     |"
msgstr ""
"        | `--data-parallel-size`     | `4`               | `8`"
"                     |"

msgid ""
"        | `--max-model-len`          | `131072`          | `1048576`"
"               |"
msgstr ""
"        | `--max-model-len`          | `131072`          | `1048576`"
"               |"

msgid ""
"        | `--max-num-batched-tokens` | `24576`           | `8192`"
"                  |"
msgstr ""
"        | `--max-num-batched-tokens` | `24576`           | `8192`"
"                  |"

msgid ""
"Run the worker command on Nodes 1 through 7 and assign each node a unique "
"`--data-parallel-start-rank` from `1` through `7`."
msgstr ""
"在节点 1 至 7 上运行工作节点命令，并为每个节点分配从 `1` 到 `7` 的唯一 `--data-parallel-start-rank`。"

msgid ""
"If a worker exits immediately, confirm that Node 0 is already running, "
"`--data-parallel-address` resolves to Node 0, and every worker uses a unique"
" `--data-parallel-start-rank`."
msgstr ""
"如果工作节点立即退出，请确认节点 0 已在运行、`--data-parallel-address` 解析为节点 0，并且每个工作节点使用唯一的 "
"`--data-parallel-start-rank`。"

msgid "Verify the service through Node 0:"
msgstr "通过节点 0 验证服务："

msgid ""
"The service should return HTTP 200 and a `choices` field containing "
"generated text."
msgstr "服务应返回 HTTP 200 以及包含生成文本的 `choices` 字段。"

msgid "=== \"Atlas 800 A3 (four-node)\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 800 A3（四节点）\""

msgid ""
"The validated mixed deployment uses four Atlas 800 A3 (64G × 16) nodes. vLLM"
" data parallelism spans the four nodes, each node runs one DP rank, and "
"tensor parallelism uses all 16 NPUs in the node. The resulting topology is "
"DP4/TP16/EP64."
msgstr ""
"经过验证的混合部署使用四个 Atlas 800 A3（64G × 16）节点。vLLM 数据并行跨越四个节点，每个节点运行一个 DP "
"rank，张量并行使用节点内全部 16 个 NPU。最终拓扑为 DP4/TP16/EP64。"

msgid ""
"On Atlas 800 A3, a mixed Prefill/Decode deployment follows the Prefill "
"execution mode. HCCL therefore uses AICPU by default; leave "
"`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` unset."
msgstr ""
"在 Atlas 800 A3 上，混合 Prefill/Decode 部署遵循 Prefill 执行模式。因此 HCCL 默认使用 AICPU；请保持 "
"`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` 未设置。"

msgid ""
"Kimi K3 on Atlas 800 A3 does not support "
"`LD_PRELOAD=/usr/lib64/libjemalloc.so.2`; run `unset LD_PRELOAD` before "
"starting vLLM."
msgstr ""
"Atlas 800 A3 上的 Kimi K3 不支持 `LD_PRELOAD=/usr/lib64/libjemalloc.so.2`；在启动 "
"vLLM 之前运行 `unset LD_PRELOAD`。"

msgid ""
"    | `--tensor-parallel-size 16`                 | Uses all 16 NPUs in one "
"A3 node for tensor parallelism.          |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--tensor-parallel-size 16`                 | 使用单个 A3 节点中的全部 16 个 NPU "
"进行张量并行。          |"

msgid ""
"    | `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192`             | Controls the scheduler "
"token budget.                             |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192`             | 控制调度器的 token 预算。"
"                             |"

msgid ""
"    | `--additional-config`                       | Enables Ascend CPU "
"binding and FlashComm1.                         |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--additional-config`                       | 启用昇腾 CPU 绑核和 FlashComm1。"
"                         |"

msgid ""
"!!! note\n"
"        Serving a 1M-token context requires at least eight Atlas 800 A3 (64G × 16) nodes. Change the following parameters on every node:"
msgstr ""
"!!! note\n"
"        服务 1M token 上下文至少需要八个 Atlas 800 A3（64G × 16）节点。请在每个节点上修改以下参数："

msgid ""
"        | `--max-num-batched-tokens` | `8192`            | `8192`"
"                  |"
msgstr ""
"        | `--max-num-batched-tokens` | `8192`            | `8192`"
"                  |"

msgid "=== \"Atlas 800 A2 (eight-node)\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 800 A2（八节点）\""

msgid ""
"The validated Atlas 800 A2 deployment uses eight nodes with eight NPUs per "
"node. Each node runs one DP rank and uses all eight local NPUs for tensor "
"parallelism. Every DP rank handles both Prefill and Decode, resulting in a "
"DP8/TP8/EP64 topology. Node 0 runs the API server and DP rank 0, while Nodes"
" 1 through 7 run headless DP workers. This baseline serves the language "
"model only."
msgstr ""
"经验证的 Atlas 800 A2 部署使用八个节点，每个节点配备八个 NPU。每个节点运行一个 DP rank，并使用全部八个本地 NPU "
"进行张量并行。每个 DP rank 同时处理 Prefill 和 Decode，形成 DP8/TP8/EP64 拓扑。节点 0 运行 API 服务器和 "
"DP rank 0，节点 1 至 7 运行无头 DP worker。此基线仅服务语言模型。"

msgid ""
"- Replace the model path, local IP address, network interface, service port, and DP RPC port with values from the target environment.\n"
"    - `NIC_NAME` must be the interface that owns `LOCAL_IP`.\n"
"    - Start Node 0 first. The `NODE0_IP` configured on Nodes 1 through 7 must equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node 0.\n"
"    - Assign a unique `DP_START_RANK` from `1` through `7` to each worker node.\n"
"    - Ensure proxy bypass settings include all API and communication IP addresses used by the eight nodes."
msgstr ""
"- 将模型路径、本地 IP 地址、网络接口、服务端口和 DP RPC 端口替换为目标环境中的值。\n"
"    - `NIC_NAME` 必须是拥有 `LOCAL_IP` 的接口。\n"
"    - 首先启动节点 0。节点 1 至 7 上配置的 `NODE0_IP` 必须等于节点 0 上的 `LOCAL_IP`。\n"
"    - 为每个 worker 节点分配一个从 `1` 到 `7` 的唯一 `DP_START_RANK`。\n"
"    - 确保代理绕过设置包含八个节点使用的所有 API 和通信 IP 地址。"

msgid "=== \"Nodes 1-7\""
msgstr "=== \"节点 1-7\""

msgid ""
"Run this command on every worker node. Set `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` to the "
"current node and set `DP_START_RANK` to a unique value from `1` through `7`."
msgstr ""
"在每个 worker 节点上运行此命令。将 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为当前节点的值，并将 `DP_START_RANK` "
"设置为从 `1` 到 `7` 的唯一值。"

msgid ""
"| Setting                      | Node 0       | Nodes 1-7"
"                         | Description                                      "
"|"
msgstr ""
"| 设置                      | 节点 0       | 节点 1-7                         | 说明"
"                                      |"

msgid ""
"    | `LOCAL_IP`                   | Node 0 IP    | Current worker IP"
"                 | Each node uses its own communication IP address. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `LOCAL_IP`                   | 节点 0 IP    | 当前 worker IP"
"                 | 每个节点使用自己的通信 IP 地址。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `NODE0_IP`                   | Not required | Node 0 IP"
"                         | Workers use this address to join the DP group.   "
"|"
msgstr ""
"    | `NODE0_IP`                   | 不需要 | 节点 0 IP                         |"
" Worker 使用此地址加入 DP 组。   |"

msgid ""
"    | `--headless`                 | Omitted      | Enabled"
"                           | Workers do not expose an API endpoint."
"           |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--headless`                 | 省略      | 启用                           "
"| Worker 不暴露 API 端点。           |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-address`    | `$LOCAL_IP`  | `$NODE0_IP`"
"                       | Always resolves to Node 0.                       |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-address`    | `$LOCAL_IP`  | `$NODE0_IP`"
"                       | 始终解析为节点 0。                       |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank` | `0`          | Unique value from `1` "
"through `7` | Every node owns one global DP rank.              |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank` | `0`          | 从 `1` 到 `7` 的唯一值 | "
"每个节点拥有一个全局 DP rank。              |"

msgid "Key A2 deployment parameters:"
msgstr "A2 部署关键参数："

msgid ""
"| Parameter                      | Description"
"                                                                     |"
msgstr ""
"| 参数                      | 说明"
"                                                                     |"

msgid ""
"    | `--tensor-parallel-size 8`     | Uses all eight NPUs in one A2 node "
"for tensor parallelism.                      |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--tensor-parallel-size 8`     | 使用单个 A2 节点中的全部八个 NPU 进行张量并行。"
"                      |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-size 8`       | Creates eight global DP ranks across "
"eight nodes.                               |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-size 8`       | 在八个节点上创建八个全局 DP rank。"
"                               |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-size-local 1` | Runs one DP rank on the current node."
"                                           |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-size-local 1` | 在当前节点上运行一个 DP rank。"
"                                           |"

msgid ""
"    | `--language-model-only`        | Disables the multimodal encoder for "
"this validated A2 baseline.                 |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--language-model-only`        | 为此经验证的 A2 基线禁用多模态编码器。"
"                 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--max-model-len 262144`       | Sets a 256K combined input and output"
" context limit.                            |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--max-model-len 262144`       | 设置 256K 的输入和输出组合上下文限制。"
"                            |"

msgid ""
"    | `--compilation-config`         | Uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph replay "
"with capture sizes `1`, `2`, `4`, and `8`. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--compilation-config`         | 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图重放，捕获大小为 "
"`1`、`2`、`4` 和 `8`。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--additional-config`          | Enables NPU graph execution and CPU "
"binding while keeping FlashComm1 disabled.  |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--additional-config`          | 启用 NPU 图执行和 CPU 绑核，同时保持 FlashComm1 "
"禁用。  |"

msgid ""
"Do not set `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=AIV` for this baseline. Start Node 0 "
"first, then start Nodes 1 through 7 as soon as possible. If a worker exits "
"immediately, verify that Node 0 is running, all nodes use the same RPC port,"
" `--data-parallel-address` resolves to Node 0, and every worker has a unique"
" DP start rank."
msgstr ""
"不要为此基线设置 `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=AIV`。首先启动节点 0，然后尽快启动节点 1 至 7。如果某个 worker "
"立即退出，请验证节点 0 正在运行、所有节点使用相同的 RPC 端口、`--data-parallel-address` 解析为节点 0，并且每个 "
"worker 具有唯一的 DP 起始 rank。"

msgid "### 5.2 Eight-Node PD Separation Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.2 八节点 PD 分离部署"

msgid ""
"The validated PD separation topology uses eight nodes: four Prefill nodes "
"and four Decode nodes. 950DT Products uses DP4/TP8 on each side, while A3 "
"uses DP4/TP16 on each side."
msgstr ""
"经验证的 PD 分离拓扑使用八个节点：四个 Prefill 节点和四个 Decode 节点。Ascend 950DT系列产品每侧使用 DP4/TP8，而"
" A3 每侧使用 DP4/TP16。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [PD Disaggregation with "
"Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) for the "
"general service workflow."
msgstr ""
"有关通用服务流程，请参阅 [使用 Mooncake 的 PD "
"分离](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。"

msgid ""
"Please refer to the [KV Cache Pool (Ascend Store) Deployment "
"Guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/zh-"
"cn/latest/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.html) for the KV Cache Pool "
"startup method and the Mooncake configuration file."
msgstr ""
"有关 KV Cache Pool 的启动方法和 Mooncake 配置文件，请参阅 [KV Cache Pool（Ascend "
"Store）部署指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/zh-"
"cn/latest/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.html)。"

msgid ""
"On 950DT Products and Atlas 800 A3, Prefill uses AICPU by default, so leave "
"`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` unset in the Prefill command. Decode uses AIV; "
"explicitly set `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=AIV` in the Decode command."
msgstr ""
"在 Ascend 950DT系列产品和 Atlas 800 A3 上，Prefill 默认使用 AICPU，因此在 Prefill 命令中不要设置 "
"`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE`。Decode 使用 AIV；请在 Decode 命令中显式设置 "
"`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=AIV`。"

msgid ""
"This deployment supports DSpark speculative decoding. Configure the same "
"`RadixArk/Kimi-K3-DSpark` GQA draft-model path and `num_speculative_tokens` "
"on both Prefill and Decode nodes. The validated configuration uses draft TP8"
" on 950DT Products or draft TP16 on A3, greedy drafting, and seven "
"speculative tokens. The seventh argument of the engine template is the "
"tensor-parallel size: `8` for 950DT Products and `16` for A3."
msgstr ""
"此部署支持 DSpark 投机解码。请在 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上配置相同的 `RadixArk/Kimi-K3-DSpark` GQA"
" 草稿模型路径和 `num_speculative_tokens`。经验证的配置在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上使用草稿 TP8，或在 A3 "
"上使用草稿 TP16，采用贪心草稿，并使用七个投机 token。引擎模板的第七个参数是张量并行大小：Ascend 950DT系列产品为 `8`，A3 为"
" `16`。"

msgid ""
"The Prefill and Decode templates below assume equal tensor-parallel sizes on"
" both sides. Both `prefill.tp_size` and `decode.tp_size` are taken from the "
"seventh template argument (`$7`) and must match the engine TP: `8` for 950DT"
" Products or `16` for A3."
msgstr ""
"下面的 Prefill 和 Decode 模板假设两侧的张量并行大小相等。`prefill.tp_size` 和 `decode.tp_size` "
"均取自模板的第七个参数（`$7`），并且必须与引擎 TP 匹配：Ascend 950DT系列产品为 `8`，A3 为 `16`。"

